const PRIVACY = "This Privacy Policy explains how Torben Heinemann (\"we,\" \"us,\" or \"our\") collects, uses, processes, and protects information in connection with this iOS application (the \"App\").\n\nBy using the App, you acknowledge the data practices described in this Privacy Policy.\n\n## Application Operator\n\nThe App is operated by:\n\nTorben Heinemann\nBlissestraße 50\nBerlin, Germany\nContact Email: torbenapp@heinemann.click\n\nThe App uses DeviantArt branding pursuant to a signed Brand and Trademark Authorization Agreement with DeviantArt, Inc.\n\nTorben Heinemann is responsible for operating the App and for the data processing activities described in this Privacy Policy.\n\n## Information We Process\n\nThe App is designed to minimize the collection of personal information.\n\n### 2.1. Creative Content\n\nWhen using AI generation features, you may provide:\n\n- Text prompts and negative prompts.\n- Reference images selected from your device.\n- Photographs captured using your camera.\n- User-created sketches.\n- Selected artistic styles and generation parameters.\n\nThis information is processed to provide the AI image-generation features requested by you.\n\n### 2.2. Locally Stored Information\n\nThe App stores the following information locally on your device:\n\n- Generated images.\n- Generation history.\n- Favorite artwork.\n- Sketches and creative settings.\n- Creative challenge progress and streaks.\n\nWe do not operate a proprietary backend for storing this information.\n\n### 2.3. Subscription Information\n\nThe App uses Apphud to manage subscriptions and verify purchase entitlements.\n\nApphud may process information necessary to provide these services, including:\n\n- Subscription status.\n- Purchase and transaction information.\n- Anonymous identifiers associated with subscription management.\n- Device and technical information required for SDK functionality.\n- Subscription-related events and interactions.\n\nPayments are processed by Apple through the App Store.\n\nWe do not directly collect or store complete payment-card information.\n\n### 2.4. Support Communications\n\nIf you contact us for support, we may receive your email address and any information you voluntarily provide.\n\nThis information is used to respond to your request and provide assistance.\n\n## Camera and Photo Library Access\n\nThe App may request access to your device's camera and photo library.\n\n### Camera Access\n\nCamera permission is used to capture reference photographs for AI artwork generation.\n\n### Photo Library Access\n\nPhoto Library access is used to select reference images and save generated artwork to your device.\n\nAccess is requested through the applicable iOS permission mechanisms.\n\nYou can manage or revoke permissions through your device settings.\n\nThe App does not automatically upload your entire photo library.\n\nOnly images selected or provided for AI processing are transmitted when necessary to perform a requested generation.\n\n## Artificial Intelligence Processing\n\nThe App uses third-party AI services provided by fal.ai to generate and process images.\n\nWhen you request AI generation, relevant information may be transmitted directly from your device to fal.ai, including:\n\n- Text prompts.\n- Selected reference images.\n- Relevant generation settings and parameters.\n\nThese inputs are processed to generate the requested artwork.\n\nThe App does not transmit video content or AI chat history for this purpose.\n\n### Third-Party Processing\n\nAI processing takes place using infrastructure operated by the third-party service provider.\n\nThe provider may process, temporarily store, or retain information in accordance with its applicable privacy practices, service terms, and technical requirements.\n\nWe do not control the provider's independent data-retention practices.\n\nThe absence of a proprietary backend does not mean that information transmitted for AI processing is never retained by third-party services.\n\nFor further information, users may consult the applicable privacy documentation published by fal.ai.\n\n## Purposes of Data Processing\n\nInformation is processed for the following purposes:\n\n- Providing AI image-generation functionality.\n- Processing user-selected reference images and prompts.\n- Managing subscriptions and purchase entitlements.\n- Maintaining locally stored creative content.\n- Responding to support requests.\n- Maintaining application functionality and security.\n- Complying with applicable legal obligations.\n\nWe do not use user-generated artwork for advertising purposes.\n\n## Legal Bases for Processing\n\nWhere the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) applies, personal information may be processed under the following legal bases:\n\n### Performance of a Contract — Article 6(1)(b)\n\nProcessing necessary to provide the App's requested features and subscription services.\n\n### Legitimate Interests — Article 6(1)(f)\n\nProcessing reasonably necessary for application security, support, service administration, and prevention of misuse, where such interests are not overridden by applicable individual rights.\n\n### Legal Obligations — Article 6(1)(c)\n\nProcessing necessary to comply with applicable laws and regulatory requirements.\n\n### Consent — Article 6(1)(a)\n\nWhere consent is required by applicable law, processing is conducted on the basis of valid consent.\n\nDevice permissions can be managed through iOS settings. Granting a device permission does not necessarily constitute consent for every data-processing activity.\n\n## Third-Party Services\n\nThe App uses the following external services:\n\n### fal.ai\n\nProvides AI image-generation and processing infrastructure.\n\nInformation submitted for AI generation may be processed according to the provider's applicable privacy practices.\n\n### Apphud\n\nProvides subscription management, purchase verification, and related subscription-service functionality.\n\n### Apple\n\nProvides App Store distribution, in-app purchases, and relevant device services.\n\nEach provider may process information according to its applicable contractual arrangements and privacy documentation.\n\nThe App does not use Firebase, a separate advertising network, a standalone analytics SDK, or a separate crash-reporting service.\n\nApphud may process subscription-related operational and technical information as described above.\n\n## Data Storage and Retention\n\nGenerated images, favorites, creative history, and related information are stored locally on your device.\n\nWe do not maintain a separate proprietary cloud database containing your creative library.\n\nLocal information may be removed by deleting the corresponding content where supported or uninstalling the App.\n\nInformation saved to your Photos library, included in device backups, or shared with other services may remain available independently of the App.\n\nThird-party service providers may retain certain information according to their applicable policies, operational requirements, and legal obligations.\n\nSubscription-related records may be retained where necessary for purchase verification, entitlement management, fraud prevention, or compliance with applicable law.\n\n## Data Sharing\n\nWe do not sell personal information or user-generated artwork to advertisers.\n\nInformation may be shared with service providers where necessary to operate the App.\n\nSuch processing may include:\n\n- AI generation requests handled by fal.ai.\n- Subscription information processed by Apphud.\n- Purchase transactions processed by Apple.\n\nWhen you choose to export or share generated artwork, the selected destination may receive the content you share.\n\nAny subsequent processing by the receiving service is governed by its applicable privacy practices.\n\nInformation may also be disclosed where required by applicable law.\n\n## International Data Transfers\n\nThird-party service providers may process information in countries outside your country of residence, including outside the European Economic Area.\n\nWhere applicable, international transfers of personal data are subject to the requirements and safeguards established by relevant data-protection legislation.\n\n## Your Privacy Rights\n\nDepending on your jurisdiction, you may have the right to:\n\n- Request access to personal information.\n- Request correction of inaccurate information.\n- Request deletion of personal information.\n- Request restriction of certain processing activities.\n- Object to processing based on legitimate interests.\n- Request data portability where applicable.\n- Withdraw consent where processing relies on consent.\n- Lodge a complaint with a competent data-protection authority.\n\nTo submit a privacy-related request, contact:\n\ntorbenapp@heinemann.click\n\nRequests will be reviewed and handled in accordance with applicable law.\n\nBecause most creative information is stored locally, certain information can be managed directly through the App or your device.\n\nDeleting locally stored information does not necessarily delete copies independently retained by external service providers or recipients.\n\n## Security\n\nWe take reasonable measures to protect information processed through the App.\n\nLocal creative content benefits from applicable device-level security mechanisms.\n\nExternal service providers maintain their own technical and organizational security measures.\n\nNo electronic transmission or storage system can be guaranteed to be completely secure.\n\n## Children's Privacy\n\nThe App is not specifically designed for children.\n\nWe do not knowingly solicit personal information from children in violation of applicable data-protection laws.\n\nIf you believe that personal information relating to a child has been processed without any required authorization or consent, please contact us.\n\n## Changes to This Privacy Policy\n\nWe may update this Privacy Policy to reflect changes in application functionality, service providers, legal requirements, or information-processing practices.\n\nThe effective date at the beginning of this document indicates the current version.\n\nWhere required by applicable law, users will receive appropriate notice of material changes.\n\n## Contact Information\n\nFor questions about this Privacy Policy or requests concerning personal information, contact:\n\nTorben Heinemann\nBerlin, Germany\nEmail: torbenapp@heinemann.click";

const TERMS = "These Terms of Use (\"Terms\") govern access to and use of this iOS application (the \"App\") operated by Torben Heinemann (\"we,\" \"us,\" or \"our\").\n\nBy accessing or using the App, you agree to these Terms.\n\nIf you do not agree with these Terms, you should not use the App.\n\n## Application Operator\n\nThe App is provided by:\n\nTorben Heinemann\nBlissestraße 50\nBerlin, Germany\nContact Email: torbenapp@heinemann.click\n\n## Application Description\n\nThe App provides AI-powered image-generation and creative tools.\n\nAvailable functionality may include:\n\n- Generating artwork from text prompts.\n- Using reference photographs and images.\n- Creating and using sketches.\n- Choosing different artistic styles.\n- Adjusting generation parameters.\n- Regenerating and editing artwork.\n- Participating in daily creative challenges.\n- Tracking creative progress and streaks.\n- Organizing generated images and favorites.\n- Saving and sharing generated artwork.\n\nCertain features require an internet connection and access to third-party AI processing services.\n\nWe may modify, improve, replace, or discontinue individual features where reasonably necessary, subject to applicable consumer rights.\n\n## Eligibility\n\nYou may use the App only where you are legally permitted to do so.\n\nYou must have the legal capacity or any authorization required under applicable law to accept these Terms.\n\nAccess to individual features may also be subject to applicable legal requirements and third-party service conditions.\n\n## Subscriptions and Payments\n\nCertain features may require a paid subscription.\n\nSubscriptions are purchased through Apple's App Store and managed using Apphud.\n\n### Subscription Terms\n\nSubscription prices and available plans are displayed before purchase.\n\nSubscription payments are processed by Apple.\n\nAuto-renewing subscriptions renew automatically unless canceled before the applicable renewal deadline.\n\nApplicable introductory offers or trial conditions are disclosed during the purchase process.\n\nSubscription access is determined by the applicable purchase and entitlement status.\n\n### Subscription Management\n\nUsers can manage or cancel subscriptions through their Apple Account subscription settings.\n\nDeleting the App does not automatically cancel an active subscription.\n\nCancellation generally prevents future renewals but does not automatically reverse payments already processed.\n\n### Refunds\n\nRefund requests are handled through Apple's applicable procedures.\n\nNothing in these Terms excludes or limits statutory consumer rights, including mandatory refund or cancellation rights where applicable.\n\n## AI Image Generation\n\nThe App uses third-party artificial intelligence technology, including services provided by fal.ai.\n\nAI-generated outputs depend on the submitted prompts, reference materials, generation settings, and technical capabilities of the AI service.\n\nGenerated results may vary and are not guaranteed to match a particular expectation.\n\nWe do not guarantee that generated artwork will be unique, accurate, free from errors, or suitable for every intended purpose.\n\nUsers are responsible for reviewing generated content before using, publishing, or distributing it.\n\n### Third-Party AI Processing\n\nText prompts, selected reference images, and relevant generation parameters are transmitted to the AI provider to perform requested generations.\n\nProcessing is subject to the provider's applicable technical requirements, service terms, and privacy practices.\n\nWe do not control all aspects of third-party service availability, processing, or data-retention practices.\n\nFurther information about data processing is provided in our Privacy Policy.\n\n## User Content and Generated Artwork\n\nYou remain responsible for the content you submit to the App.\n\nThis may include:\n\n- Text prompts.\n- Reference photographs.\n- Imported images.\n- Sketches.\n- Other materials used for image generation.\n\nYou must have the necessary rights or permissions to submit and process such materials.\n\nYou must not knowingly submit content in violation of applicable laws or third-party rights.\n\n### Rights in User Content\n\nWe do not claim ownership of original materials you submit solely because you use the App.\n\nBy submitting content for generation, you authorize the processing necessary to provide the requested functionality, including processing by the relevant third-party AI provider.\n\n### Generated Content\n\nRights in AI-generated content depend on applicable law, third-party intellectual-property rights, and the terms governing the relevant generation technology.\n\nWe do not guarantee that generated content qualifies for copyright protection or that it is free from third-party claims.\n\nUsers are responsible for determining whether their intended use of generated artwork complies with applicable laws and third-party rights.\n\n## Acceptable Use\n\nYou agree not to use the App to:\n\n- Generate or distribute unlawful content.\n- Infringe copyrights, trademarks, or other intellectual-property rights.\n- Violate another person's privacy or publicity rights.\n- Create content involving the sexual exploitation of minors.\n- Engage in fraud, harassment, threats, or unlawful impersonation.\n- Circumvent technical restrictions or security mechanisms.\n- Interfere with the functionality or security of the App.\n- Abuse AI generation services through unauthorized automated activity.\n- Otherwise violate applicable laws or regulations.\n\nWe may restrict access to functionality where reasonably necessary to prevent misuse, comply with legal obligations, or enforce these Terms.\n\n## Local Storage and Sharing\n\nGenerated artwork, creative history, favorites, and related information are stored locally on your device.\n\nThe App does not provide a proprietary cloud-storage service for your creative library.\n\nYou may save generated artwork to your device's Photos library or share it through available system-sharing options.\n\nYou are responsible for maintaining copies of content you wish to preserve.\n\nRemoving the App or deleting locally stored information may result in the loss of creative content.\n\nWhen sharing artwork through third-party platforms, their respective terms and policies may apply.\n\n## Intellectual Property and Brand Authorization\n\nThe App's software, interface, design elements, trademarks, logos, and other protected materials are subject to applicable intellectual-property laws.\n\n### DeviantArt Brand Authorization\n\nThe App is developed and distributed under a signed Brand and Trademark Authorization Agreement with DeviantArt, Inc.\n\nThe agreement authorizes the use of the DeviantArt brand and associated trademark and visual identity elements in connection with the App, subject to the scope and conditions of that agreement.\n\nAll ownership rights in the DeviantArt name, trademarks, logos, and related brand assets remain with their respective rights holders.\n\nThe authorization does not transfer ownership of DeviantArt intellectual property to the App operator or its users.\n\nUsers receive no independent license to reproduce, distribute, or commercially exploit DeviantArt trademarks or brand assets outside their permitted use of the App.\n\n### Application License\n\nSubject to these Terms, you receive a limited, personal, non-exclusive, non-transferable license to use the App on Apple-branded devices you own or control, in accordance with Apple's applicable usage rules.\n\nYou may not reproduce, distribute, reverse engineer, or commercially exploit the App or its protected components except as permitted by applicable law or expressly authorized in writing.\n\n## Third-Party Services\n\nThe App integrates third-party services necessary for its functionality.\n\nThese include:\n\n- fal.ai — AI image generation and processing.\n- Apphud — subscription management and purchase verification.\n- Apple — App Store distribution, in-app purchases, and device-related services.\n\nUse of these services may be subject to their respective terms, technical conditions, and privacy policies.\n\nWe are not responsible for independent actions of third-party service providers outside our reasonable control, except where liability cannot be excluded under applicable law.\n\n## Service Availability\n\nWe aim to provide reliable application functionality.\n\nHowever, access to AI generation may be affected by:\n\n- Internet connectivity.\n- Third-party service availability.\n- Server capacity and processing limitations.\n- Maintenance and software updates.\n- Legal or technical restrictions.\n\nWe do not guarantee uninterrupted or error-free operation.\n\nService availability and functionality may change where reasonably necessary, subject to applicable consumer-protection requirements.\n\n## Disclaimer of Warranties\n\nTo the extent permitted by applicable law, the App and its AI-generated outputs are provided without guarantees of uninterrupted availability, specific creative outcomes, originality, or fitness for a particular purpose.\n\nAI-generated content may contain unexpected results, inaccuracies, or similarities to existing material.\n\nYou are responsible for evaluating generated artwork before relying on or distributing it.\n\nNothing in these Terms excludes warranties or consumer rights that cannot legally be excluded.\n\n## Limitation of Liability\n\nTo the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, we are not liable for losses arising solely from circumstances outside our reasonable control, including interruptions of third-party services or misuse of generated content by users.\n\nNothing in these Terms limits or excludes liability that cannot lawfully be limited or excluded.\n\nIn particular, mandatory rights relating to intentional misconduct, gross negligence where applicable, injury to life, body or health, and statutory consumer protection remain unaffected.\n\n## Suspension and Termination\n\nYou may stop using the App at any time.\n\nWe may restrict or suspend access where reasonably necessary to address serious misuse, security concerns, violations of these Terms, or legal obligations.\n\nAny such action will be subject to applicable law and mandatory consumer rights.\n\nStopping use of the App does not automatically cancel an active subscription.\n\nSubscriptions must be managed through Apple.\n\n## Apple App Store Provisions\n\nThe App is distributed through Apple's App Store.\n\nApple is not a party to these Terms and is not responsible for operating the App or providing its AI generation functionality.\n\nPayments and subscription transactions are handled according to Apple's applicable purchase terms.\n\nTo the extent required by Apple's applicable conditions, Apple and its subsidiaries are third-party beneficiaries of these Terms and may enforce applicable provisions.\n\nYour use of the App is also subject to Apple's applicable usage rules.\n\n## Changes to These Terms\n\nWe may update these Terms to reflect changes in application functionality, applicable laws, technical requirements, or service arrangements.\n\nUpdated Terms will become effective when published or otherwise communicated, subject to applicable notice and consent requirements.\n\nChanges will not remove statutory rights already acquired by users.\n\n## Governing Law\n\nThese Terms are governed by the laws of Germany, excluding conflict-of-laws principles, except where mandatory consumer-protection provisions require otherwise.\n\nConsumers residing in other jurisdictions retain the protection of mandatory laws applicable in their country of habitual residence.\n\nNothing in these Terms restricts access to courts or remedies available under mandatory consumer-protection legislation.\n\n## Contact Information\n\nFor questions concerning these Terms, subscription functionality, or the operation of the App, contact:\n\nTorben Heinemann\nBerlin, Germany\nEmail: torbenapp@heinemann.click";

